'''The Dead & The Bloated''' (亡者と河豚, ''Mōja to Fugu'', '''Dead and Blowfish''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Sequential Advent Stage|Sequential Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]]. It has one stage, with an extra [[Continuation Stage]] that grants 3 Legend [[Catseye]]s as a [[Catnip Challenges|Catnip Challenge]] reward. These stages are exact copies of [[Parade of the Dead (Deadly)|Parade of the Dead]] and [[Puffer Planet (Merciless)|Puffer Planet]] respectively. To unlock The Dead & The Bloated, you must clear both Dead on Debut and Blue Impact.

